  "mechanism": "tau is the median of the S1 labels usable at the origin, so training labels are ~50/50 by construction; Balance Luzon hunger rose from about 9-12% (2021-2023) to 15-25% (2024-2026), so almost every test quarter is above the trailing median and test labels are ~90% HIGH. LOW test rows occur only where a quarter's H fell back below the trailing median."
